        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of this game is to step on checkpoint tiles in the level and return to your respawn point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R for respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step on any tiles (except the respawn point) and move on to another tile, the previously stepped tile will dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/ebe28ed7a1c282955d67228d3fe01028.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step on the checkpoint tile (black tile) and make the tile dissolve, the checkpoint's remaining number on the top left will decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/c8cb08208643a70677ba2f627e197d63.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you dissolve all of the checkpoints in the level, the stripe color of the respawn will change to green. Stepping it grants you access to the next level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/c0c3cda6e9b18080343a3a2fd11d6532.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From level 2, you can place a tile by clicking the cell; however, each level has a limited number of tiles you can place, so be careful.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/691ae39970378786168fc9c805be5ca0.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of this game is to step on checkpoint tiles in the level and return to your respawn point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R for respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step on any tiles (except the respawn point) and move on to another tile, the previously stepped tile will dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/ebe28ed7a1c282955d67228d3fe01028.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step on the checkpoint tile (black tile) and make the tile dissolve, the checkpoint's remaining number on the top left will decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/c8cb08208643a70677ba2f627e197d63.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you dissolve all of the checkpoints in the level, the stripe color of the respawn will change to green. Stepping it grants you access to the next level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/c0c3cda6e9b18080343a3a2fd11d6532.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From level 2, you can place a tile by clicking the cell; however, each level has a limited number of tiles you can place, so be careful.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055490/extras/691ae39970378786168fc9c805be5ca0.avif?t=1761775507\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
